{"id":"af91c7c6c3cd560b","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-post-3.md","title":"Post Algebra 3","display":"Post Algebra 3","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-post-3","aliases":["93-fact-post-3"],"display":"Post Algebra 3","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-post-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-post-3"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-post-3</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Post Algebra 3"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ce60c713fd9ffed\" href=\"?note=0ce60c713fd9ffed\" title=\"93-df-post-algebra\">93-df-post-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"fact-post-3-—-Post-Algebra-3\">fact-post-3 — Post Algebra 3</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P_3\">\\(\\mathbf P_3\\)</span> is the three-element generator defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ce60c713fd9ffed\" href=\"?note=0ce60c713fd9ffed\" title=\"93-df-post-algebra\">93-df-post-algebra</a>, with carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_3=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(P_3=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,3}\">\\(\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,3}\\)</span> is the corresponding Post-algebra predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}post\\text{-}3}\\vdash\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,3}(\\mathbf P_3)\\land|P_3|=3\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}post\\text{-}3}\\vdash\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,3}(\\mathbf P_3)\\land|P_3|=3\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Post algebras extend Boolean algebras with operations for many-valued\nlogic.  The number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3^3=27\">\\(3^3=27\\)</span> counts ternary tuples of truth values, not\nelements of the three-valued algebra.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"fact-post-3-—-Post-Algebra-3","text":"fact-post-3 — Post Algebra 3","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-post-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"0ce60c713fd9ffed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-post-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-post-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"0ce60c713fd9ffed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf P_3$ is the three-element generator defined in [[93-df-post-algebra]], with carrier $P_3=\\{0,1,2\\}$.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P_3","display":false},{"tex":"P_3=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}post\\text{-}3}\\vdash\\mathrm{PostAlg}_{93,3}(\\mathbf P_3)\\land|P_3|=3","display":true},{"tex":"3^3=27","display":false}],"bytes":797,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0ce60c713fd9ffed"]}